(7339500, 1146824, 103142, '<td valign="top">I actually like this a lot, but it seems so underexposed, it''s hard to get past that. 6 for the fun and idea, but I think the photo itself could be better.</td>', 'I actually like this a lot, but it seems so underexposed, it''s hard to get past that. 6 for the fun and idea, but I think the photo itself could be better.', '2015-04-08 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339503, 1146739, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun. It gave me a smile. Your whites seem a bit painfully bright. I think it would have been much better with those taken down a bit. <br/> <br/>Ummm... is he wearing any pants?!</td>', 'Fun. It gave me a smile. Your whites seem a bit painfully bright. I think it would have been much better with those taken down a bit.  Ummm... is he wearing any pants?!', '2015-04-08 09:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339506, 1146816, 103142, '<td valign="top">The vignette seems a tad heavy and it''s tilted a bit (Perspective correction, perhaps? or even just a little rotating? Not sure which one...) But the photo bomber did an excellent job! 7 for the sheer joy of the photo bomber. However, I think the photo could have been a bit better.</td>', 'The vignette seems a tad heavy and it''s tilted a bit (Perspective correction, perhaps? or even just a little rotating? Not sure which one...) But the photo bomber did an excellent job! 7 for the sheer joy of the photo bomber. However, I think the photo could have been a bit better.', '2015-04-08 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339509, 1146811, 103142, '<td valign="top">The sign is funny, but the photo is exposed for the sky and the tree to the left (imo). I think the photo could be better done. Add the right exposure, and a person in the background in a bathing suit, and it would have been a lot more interesting. :)</td>', 'The sign is funny, but the photo is exposed for the sky and the tree to the left (imo). I think the photo could be better done. Add the right exposure, and a person in the background in a bathing suit, and it would have been a lot more interesting. :)', '2015-04-08 09:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339511, 1146896, 103142, '<td valign="top">The shadows are harsh on this one. And I''m curious what it would have looked like if you got more down on the driver''s level. Fun idea, but I''m not sure it goes over very well in this photo.</td>', 'The shadows are harsh on this one. And I''m curious what it would have looked like if you got more down on the driver''s level. Fun idea, but I''m not sure it goes over very well in this photo.', '2015-04-08 09:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
